Type: Project
Package: quartifyr.r
Title: quartifyr R Orchestration Environment
Version: 0.1.0
Description: renv-managed R environment providing render_report(), the
    pass-1+pass-2 orchestration driver chaining a Quarto shell render
    with reportifyr's fill step. Not an installable package -- this
    DESCRIPTION exists so renv has an explicit dependency manifest,
    independent of what any individual .R file happens to reference via
    library()/::.
Imports:
    here,
    yaml,
    jsonlite,
    withr,
    processx,
    pyro,
    reportifyr
Remotes:
